This extension mod depends on and extends MWGSM Roaming Trader.

All rights to the original MWGSM Roaming Trader code and design remain with
Muddywaters Gaming & Server Management LLC (MWGSM).

The REBS_MWGSM_TraderExt additions (static trader system, vehicle spawn helpers,
separate config) are provided for use with the original mod.

When publishing to the Steam Workshop you MUST:
1. List MWGSM Roaming Trader as a required dependency.
2. Respect any license / redistribution terms set by MWGSM.
3. Not claim the original roaming trader system as your own work.

Contact MWGSM for commercial / redistribution questions regarding the parent mod.
